Sat Dec  7 23:03:46 UTC 2013 - zaitor@opensuse.org

- Update to version 0.23.0:
  + Correct return value of special_map_button.
  + Fix buffer overflows in 'special_map_*'.
  + Add support for Intuos Pro series.
